# Comparison-teacher cell on the hard draw (2026-10-21): one DAgger round of the
# frozen screen student (the 2026-10-01 ranked cell's round-2 adapter, the hard
# draw's screen-arm starting point at 174/209) on the hard training draw (256
# roots) under the ledger_ranked_compare teacher: ledger_ranked plus the bounded
# candidate comparison before an ambiguous parameter correction
# (compare_parameter_candidates; docs/rl_experiments_20261014.md section 12, where
# the teacher alone scores 96/96 training and 73/73 development parameter roots
# against ledger_ranked's 92 and 65).  Chain d0 -> r1c -> r1t -> r1e.
#
# Stage 0 regenerates the expert aggregate with the comparison teacher (the pool
# the collected rows mix with has to demonstrate the comparison on ambiguous
# parameter states; a ledger_ranked pool would teach the top-line commit the
# comparison replaces) and links the frozen adapter as bc0.  The suites are not
# drawn: launch_compare_cell_20261021.sh copies the hard draw's screen files from
# the RL pilot's data directory (hard_training_screen.json as r1_training.json,
# hard_development_screen.json as development.json) with a copied-suite receipt
# before submission, and check_suite_exclusion.py confirms after stage 0 that
# the regenerated aggregate drew none of the hard draw's roots (the 2026-10-01
# and 2026-10-07 aggregates share none with it).  r1c collects on the 256 hard
# training roots, r1t continues the adapter for one pass on the 1:1 mixture, r1e
# scores the frozen student, the adapted candidate and the comparison teacher on
# the 209 hard development roots (the RL control is 174, the teacher 201).
# Corpora, plans, seeds and the detector are the IEEE-14 defaults of pipeline.env.
# Deploy and submit from Windows (SSH master up):
#   bash research/hpc/full_pipeline_20260907/launch_compare_cell_20261021.sh
# which runs PIPE=/scratch/yx3882/research_full_pipeline_20261021_compare
# SOURCE_CELL=/scratch/yx3882/rl_pilot_20261014 BASE=d2206f3
# OVERRIDES=compare_hard_20261021.env deploy_cell_from_windows.sh <commit40> with
# the suite copy in REMOTE_PREPARE, then CHAIN="d0 r1c r1t r1e" bash submit_pipeline.sh.
EXPERT_VARIANT=ledger_ranked_compare
EVIDENCE_PROFILE=suspicion_gated_diagnostics
HIF_SIGNATURE_MODE=discovered
# Student for round 1: the round-2 adapter of the 2026-10-01 ranked cell (IEEE 14,
# same profile), linked as this run's bc0 by stage 0; r1t continues it.
FROZEN_STUDENT_ADAPTER=/scratch/yx3882/research_full_pipeline_20261001_ranked/out/r2/training/lora
FROZEN_STUDENT_EVIDENCE_PROFILE=suspicion_gated_diagnostics
ZEROSHOT_EVAL_NAME=zeroshot
PREVIOUS_PIPE=
